@startuml
title UC-PR-003 提交摄制成果 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "摄制承接成员" as A
boundary "接口:普通成员接口" as B
control "控制:提交摄制成果控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "P:摄制预约" as P
participant "O:成果" as O
participant "N:成员" as N
A -> B: 提交摄制成果(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 提交摄制成果(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> P: 提交摄制成果(承接人、成果、指定归档人)
activate P
P -> O: 验证完整性(拍摄或制作成果)
O --> P: 完整性结论
P -> N: 验证归属(办公部普通成员)
N --> P: 归档资格
P --> C: 待归档结果或拒绝原因
deactivate P
opt 提交成功
  C -> M: 沿用归档偏好(本次指定归档人)
  M --> C: 偏好已保留
end

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
